tions need not have identical transactions at boundaries."],"limit":"37 single-factor configurations plus exactly 3 predeclared first-year-selected combinations, six periods each = 240 simulations. 40 full-period project records reproduce these, not new research trials. No expansion after results.","caveat":"Both years already inspected repeatedly; chronological selection here checks transfer within reused history, not untouched out-of-sample. No claim that the best tested value is a long-term global optimum."}
